VALUES (48831, 'tt0064612', NULL, 'My Night at Maud''s', 'Ma nuit chez Maud', 'movie', 1969, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9usKgth3ROn4LwPQ7tTvxKnpBGL.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zNMMKmyZ2W5viK2iqbsRfaQIa2u.jpg', 'Devout Roman Catholic Jean-Louis subscribes to an austere moral code influenced by the philosophy of 17th-century physicist Blaise Pascal. When he spots a pretty girl at church, he promises to one day marry her. But then an old friend introduces him to alluring divorcee Maud. After a conversation about love and credo, the chaste Jean-Louis spends the night at Maud''s, conflicted about his desires.', NULL, NULL, 3.1471, 7.633, 0, 10.51, '2026-10-10 20:20:08', '2026-10-10 20:20:08')
