VALUES (33358, 'tt0424287', NULL, 'The Mostly Unfabulous Social Life of Ethan Green', 'The Mostly Unfabulous Social Life of Ethan Green', 'movie', 2005, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pbZx18g9NlDzvsCCkajRbZu16cJ.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ArIoeXp9mIxPJHqOvehURsqIcrZ.jpg', 'Ethan Green (Daniel Letterle) has no problem finding guys who want to sleep with him or even date him, but finding someone to settle down with is a different story. Given three choices -- a sexy teenager, a hunky jock, or his ex-boyfriend who is about to get married -- will he find a Mr. Right, or is he destined to an unfabulous existence. Based on a popular gay-themed comic strip.', NULL, NULL, 2.2472, 5.4, 0, 10.51, '2026-10-10 20:20:08', '2026-10-10 20:20:08')
